<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,994.30 pts.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,994.30 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index finished officially at 6,994.30 points, up 123.73, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 5.878 billion forints, up from 3.922 billion on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
